  "description": "Detective Kim Seah is finally about to arrest her parents' killer, the man she's spent a lifetime chasing, when an accident causes her to be reborn as Lady Cersia Emblem. She thinks she'll finally have an easy life, until she is betrothed to Enoch Gray, son of the house that's rivaled hers for generations. Cersia just can't bring herself to like Enoch and keeps seeing her old nemesis in him. Is she bound to this marital pact, or can she find a way to escape her mortal enemy?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
